            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Jarvis 0.19.19</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Telegram is here. Connect it in Settings → Telegram by scanning a QR code
      with your phone, the way Telegram Desktop signs in.</li>
  <li>Pick what Jarvis reads with People, Groups and Channels tabs, or turn on
      All people / All groups so a new person who writes to you is read too.</li>
  <li>Jarvis never stores your Telegram password or messages. Only the
      encrypted sign-in session and your chat names stay on this Mac, and
      Disconnect erases both.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
